{"_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "John Comes Home for a Visit"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "What I Do at Work"}, {"type": "position", "content": 8}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 1}, {"type": "level", "content": "A2.2"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Accurately use information about people's jobs and places of work in communicative situations."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Writes a brief text about the advantages and disadvantages of specific forms of communication through the appropriate use of grammar, vocabulary, syntaxes and spelling aspects related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Writes a brief text about the advantages and disadvantages of specific forms of communication through the appropriate use of grammar, vocabulary, syntaxes and spelling aspects related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Writes a brief text about the advantages and disadvantages of specific forms of communication through the appropriate use of grammar, vocabulary, syntaxes and spelling aspects related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Writes a brief text about the advantages and disadvantages of specific forms of communication through the appropriate use of grammar, vocabulary, syntaxes and spelling aspects related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Writes a brief text about the advantages and disadvantages of specific forms of communication through the appropriate use of grammar, vocabulary, syntaxes and spelling aspects related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Writes a brief text about the advantages and disadvantages of specific forms of communication through the appropriate use of grammar, vocabulary, syntaxes and spelling aspects related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Writes a brief text about the advantages and disadvantages of specific forms of communication through the appropriate use of grammar, vocabulary, syntaxes and spelling aspects related to this level."}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Work Routines"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "Daily routines are things you do every day. <br/><br/>When you talk about daily routines, you use the Present tense and a preposition of time like <span class=\"strong\">at, until, by</span> and <span class=\"strong\">from\u2026 to</span>. <br/><br/>You use expressions of time like <span class=\"strong\">On Saturdays...</span> to say that you do things on a regular basis."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":7,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Preposition or Expression of Time\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Use\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Example\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"at\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"a specific time\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I wake up at 7:00 a.m.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"until\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"a period of time leading up to a specific time\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I'm in class until 3:00 in the afternoon.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"by\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"at or before\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I should be home by 6:00. </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"from...to\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"the beginning and ending time of an activity\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I have classes from 9:00 to 3:00 every day.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"on (Saturdays)...\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" on the same day of the week  \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> I don't have classes on Saturdays.</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "commuter train"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to travel regularly to and from a place and especially between where you live and where you work"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Peter takes the commuter train every day."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le01ob08aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use to talk about daily routines."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "workout"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a period of physical exercise"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I often try to get in a workout before heading home."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le01ob08aud02"}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn5le01ob08re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Adverbs of Frequency"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "Adverbs of frequency (always, usually, never, etc.) say how often something happens."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":5,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Adverb\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"How Often?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"always\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"100%\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"usually\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"60%\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"rarely\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"10%\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"never\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"0%\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "a head start"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to begin early compared to others"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I like to get a head start on my day."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le01ob08aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "from scratch"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "from basic ingredients"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I like to make my food from scratch."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le01ob08aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "pre-packaged"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "food that was cooked and prepared earlier"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I don't like to eat pre-packaged food."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le01ob08aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to edit"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to proofread and change "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I edit my work at night."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le01ob08aud06"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Interview a partner or family member about their routine."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write a paragraph about what they do during the day."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Use paragraph structure."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Include adverbs of frequency."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Read your paragraph aloud."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I interview a partner or family member about their daily routine."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I proofread my paragraph."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I read the paragraph aloud."}]}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"_data": [], "template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"id": 1, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn5le01ob08re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn5le01ob08re2img06.jpg", "images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn5le01ob08re2img06.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Amanda</span>: You look terrible! Are you ok?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Yeah, I'm just tired. I can't seem to get into a routine that works for me.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Amanda</span>: What do you mean?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Well, I always get up at 6 a.m. and catch the early commuter train to work.  I like to get a head start on the day.", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn5le01ob08re2img06.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Amanda</span>: Ok ... What time do you get home?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: I never get home until 7 p.m.  I often try to get in a workout before heading home.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Amanda</span>: I get home earlier than that.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Then  I make myself something from scratch. You know I like to cook. I don't like pre-packaged food. Forty-five minutes later, my dinner is ready.", "id": 2, "time": "17000", "image": "engenn5le01ob08re2img02.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Amanda</span>: When do you get to bed?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Not before 11 p.m. I edit my reports at night when it's quiet.  The office is too noisy. Plus, I have to write that paragraph for the new intern! Geez.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Amanda</span>: That's right. Boy, you do have a crazy routine!", "id": 3, "time": "36500", "image": "engenn5le01ob08re2img06.jpg"}]}}]}, {"id": 2, "type": "video", "title": "", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"type": "video", "value": {"video_src": "engenn5le01ob08re3vid01", "images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": ""}, {"text": "<span class = \"bullet\">Peter's Job Description</span>", "id": 1, "time": "1", "image": ""}, {"text": "<span class = \"bullet\">Topic Sentence</span>", "id": 2, "time": "22000", "image": ""}, {"text": "<span class = \"bullet\">Supporting Sentences</span>", "id": 3, "time": "38000", "image": ""}, {"text": "<span class = \"bullet\">Concluding Sentence</span>", "id": 4, "time": "85000", "image": ""}]}}]}], "exercises": [{"questions": [], "stimuli_ids": [0], "id": 0, "type": "WLC", "img_path": "", "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": "I can talk about jobs and work."}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": "I can write a short paragraph. "}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": "I can use adverbs of frequency."}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": "What is your daily routine? "}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": "Does your routine ever change?"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Welcome"}]}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "correct_feedback": "Correct", "attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "You have 2 tries"}, {"type": "text", "content": "you have 1 attempt left"}], "incorrec